making a break for it.

01:20:22.357 --> 01:20:25.255
Well, good news, I just made
a salon appointment with Mark,

01:20:25.290 --> 01:20:26.856
and he's gonna beat them
back in today.

01:20:26.891 --> 01:20:28.830
ANDREW: Mmm.

01:20:28.865 --> 01:20:31.429
