-(CHUCKLES)

01:20:34.937 --> 01:20:36.573
Andy, hi.
I'm so sorry I'm late.

01:20:36.609 --> 01:20:39.038
-Oh, that's okay.
-(DOOR CLOSES)

01:20:39.073 --> 01:20:41.841
Stopped by
that Thai place you like.

01:20:41.877 --> 01:20:43.042
Want me
to make you a cocktail?

01:20:43.077 --> 01:20:46.015
-There she is. Hi. Hi.
-Hi. (CHUCKLING)

01:20:48.012 --> 01:20:49.414
(ANDREW MOANS)

01:20:57.859 --> 01:20:58.892
Was someone a silly goose

01:20:58.928 --> 01:21:00.329
and forget
to get their roots done?

01:21:00.364 --> 01:21:02.292
Mmm. Mm. Mm.

01:21:02.327 --> 01:21:03.833
I got caught
at the park with Cece

01:21:03.869 --> 01:21:06.534
before I dropped her off
at Lena's. I'm sorry.

01:21:06.570 --> 01:21:07.967
