a hand with something?

01:21:15.247 --> 01:21:16.276
(EXHALES)

01:21:17.710 --> 01:21:19.048
What?

01:21:19.083 --> 01:21:21.347
I just have this last-minute
meeting with the board,

01:21:21.382 --> 01:21:23.380
and there's these notes.
I cannot seem to find them.

01:21:23.415 --> 01:21:25.554
I think they're upstairs
in the storage room.

01:21:25.589 --> 01:21:26.622
-Right now?
-Yeah.

01:21:26.658 --> 01:21:28.184
-Yeah.
-Can you give me a hand?

01:21:28.219 --> 01:21:30.556
-You know it.
-Thank you.

01:21:30.592 --> 01:21:31.824
NINA: Ah.

01:21:31.860 --> 01:21:33.656
I'll go turn the light on.

01:21:34.465 --> 01:21:35.726
I'll be right up.

01:21:35.761 --> 01:21:37.363
Okay.

01:21:41.769 --> 01:21:43.006
(LOCK CLICKS)

01:22:03.960 --> 01:22:06.392
-Babe, there's no files in here.
-I know.

01:22:06.859 --> 01:22:08.229
NINA: Babe.

01:22:16.709 --> 01:22:18.971
-(DOORKNOB RATTLING)
-(CHUCKLES)

01:22:19.006 --> 01:22:20.439
-Andy.
-(DOORKNOB RATTLING)

01:22:21.074 --> 01:22:23.512
-Andy?
-(KNOCKING AT DOOR)

01:22:23.547 --> 01:22:24.848
ANDREW: I'm here.

01:22:24.883 --> 01:22:26.913
