-(DOORKNOB RATTLING)

01:22:26.948 --> 01:22:28.952
I am very disappointed, Nina.

01:22:28.988 --> 01:22:32.055
(CHUCKLING) What the fuck
are you talking about?

01:22:32.090 --> 01:22:36.118
Your hair is a privilege
and it needs to be cared for.

01:22:36.153 --> 01:22:37.588
(DOORKNOB RATTLES)

01:22:38.396 --> 01:22:39.491
NINA: Um...

01:22:40.595 --> 01:22:42.261
My hair?

01:22:42.296 --> 01:22:43.760
Are you aware
of how embarrassing it is

01:22:43.795 --> 01:22:47.001
to have your wife walking around
town with her roots showing?

01:22:47.036 --> 01:22:49.701
I'm gonna make
another appointment,

01:22:49.737 --> 01:22:50.903
I told ya.

01:22:50.938 --> 01:22:53.369
I need you to be better.

01:22:53.405 --> 01:22:55.408
For the both of us.
I really do.

01:22:55.443 --> 01:22:59.377
Andy, I'm gonna get
my fucking roots fixed, okay?

01:22:59.413 --> 01:23:01.779
So you can let me out
of the room now, please.

01:23:01.814 --> 01:23:03.045
I will.

01:23:03.081 --> 01:23:05.014
Just not yet.

01:23:05.049 --> 01:23:08.825
I need you to understand
that there are consequences
to your actions.

01:23:08.860 --> 01:23:10.886
What are you
fucking talking about?

01:23:10.921 --> 01:23:14.427
I have an envelope, which I will
be sliding under the door.

01:23:17.198 --> 01:23:19.699
Now, listen
very carefully, please.

01:23:19.735 --> 01:23:22.072
I need you to...

01:23:22.507 --> 01:23:24.874
pluck 100 hairs

01:23:24.909 --> 01:23:28.137
from your scalp
with the roots intact.

01:23:28.173 --> 01:23:29.811
-Um, what?
-Nina,

01:23:29.846 --> 01:23:31.911
I need to see those follicles.

01:23:31.946 --> 01:23:33.344
Okay, babe, you got me.

01:23:33.379 --> 01:23:35.580
-(DOORKNOB RATTLING)
-That was good.

01:23:36.916 --> 01:23:38.220
You got me.

01:23:38.754 --> 01:23:40.018
Please let me out.

01:23:40.053 --> 01:23:42.023
Once you've done that,

01:23:42.058 --> 01:23:43.924
please put them back
in the envelope

01:23:43.959 --> 01:23:45.224
and slide it under the door,

01:23:45.259 --> 01:23:47.330
and then we can discuss
your freedom.

01:23:47.365 --> 01:23:48.663
Andy!

01:23:48.698 --> 01:23:50.133
This isn't funny!

01:23:51.032 --> 01:23:53.432
-(BANGING ON DOOR)
-Andy!

01:23:53.468 --> 01:23:54.970
-I'm not doing this anymore.
-(DOORKNOB RATTLING)

01:23:55.006 --> 01:23:57.572
Please let me out
of the fucking room!

01:23:57.608 --> 01:23:58.873
I'm so sorry.

01:23:58.908 --> 01:24:01.875
-Andy.
-(KNOCKING AT DOOR)

01:24:01.910 --> 01:24:03.410
And I love you so much.

01:24:03.843 --> 01:24:05.115
Babe?

01:24:05.779 --> 01:24:06.912
Babe?

01:24:06.947 --> 01:24:08.483
(KNOCKING AT DOOR)

01:24:08.518 --> 01:24:10.016
Andy?

01:24:10.051 --> 01:24:11.983
-Andy!
-(BANGING ON DOOR)

01:24:12.019 --> 01:24:15.554
Cece! Andy! Please!

01:24:15.989 --> 01:24:17.259
-(BANGS)
-Fuck!

01:24:18.630 --> 01:24:20.325
(DOOR OPENS AND CLOSES)

01:24:20.361 --> 01:24:22.561
NINA: Who was
 this man I married?

01:24:24.195 --> 01:24:26.103
 What had I done

01:24:26.703 --> 01:24:28.138
 to deserve this?

01:24:30.508 --> 01:24:32.269
 No food.

01:24:32.304 --> 01:24:35.177
 Three tiny bottles of water.

01:24:35.213 --> 01:24:39.282
 The only bathroom was
 a bucket in the closet.

01:24:39.317 --> 01:24:41.984
 I thought back to when it was
 just me and you, Cece.

01:24:42.020 --> 01:24:45.122
 I had no idea
 how good we had it.

01:24:47.625 --> 01:24:50.886
 Even if we were constantly
 on the brink
 of financial disaster.

01:24:52.962 --> 01:24:54.890
 Now what choice did I have

01:24:55.799 --> 01:24:57.596
 but to obey this fucker

01:24:59.168 --> 01:25:00.863
 if I ever wanted
 to see you again?

01:25:05.906 --> 01:25:07.309
(WHIMPERS)

01:25:09.712 --> 01:25:10.741
(WHIMPERS)

01:25:50.785 --> 01:25:51.947
Andrew,

01:25:52.991 --> 01:25:55.792
I did everything
that you asked me to do.

01:25:55.827 --> 01:25:57.324
Can you let me out, please?

01:25:57.359 --> 01:26:00.291
One of the strands didn't
have a follicle,

01:26:00.326 --> 01:26:01.927
so you have to start again.

01:26:01.963 --> 01:26:03.425
(INHALES) What?

01:26:03.460 --> 01:26:05.132
Andrew, Andrew, please.

01:26:05.168 --> 01:26:07.369
Please be more careful
this time.

01:26:07.936 --> 01:26:09.268
(BANGING ON DOOR)

01:26:09.304 --> 01:26:11.236
-Andrew! Please!
-(BANGING ON DOOR)

01:26:11.272 --> 01:26:13.474
(CRYING) Please!
Andrew, please!

01:26:13.973 --> 01:26:15.674
Andrew!

01:26:22.047 --> 01:26:23.451
(SIGHS)

01:26:27.793 --> 01:26:30.557
Oh... (GRUNTING) ...fuck!

01:26:37.768 --> 01:26:40.534
(LOCK CLICKING)

01:26:46.172 --> 01:26:47.475
(CLEARS THROAT)

01:26:48.506 --> 01:26:50.412
This was for your own good.

01:26:51.947 --> 01:26:53.049
If you'd let me,

01:26:53.084 --> 01:26:54.977
I can help you
become a better person.

01:26:56.181 --> 01:26:57.518
NINA: Mmm.

01:26:59.185 --> 01:27:00.686
(GROANS SOFTLY)

01:27:01.286 --> 01:27:02.952
(PANTING) Cece.

01:27:04.496 --> 01:27:05.724
Cece!

01:27:09.832 --> 01:27:11.760
(PANTING)

01:27:11.796 --> 01:27:15.602
Oh, baby, hi. Hi, come here.
Come here.

01:27:27.016 --> 01:27:28.516
(SINISTER MUSIC PLAYING)

01:27:52.436 --> 01:27:54.476
(CECE CRYING)

01:27:55.580 --> 01:27:56.775
(STIRS)

01:28:04.723 --> 01:28:05.817
(WATER RUNNING)

01:28:07.658 --> 01:28:08.688
Oh.

01:28:15.967 --> 01:28:17.895
(WATER CONTINUES RUNNING)

01:28:22.070 --> 01:28:23.703
(NINA PANTING)

01:28:25.808 --> 01:28:26.871
Cece!

01:28:28.943 --> 01:28:31.108
No!

01:28:31.143 --> 01:28:33.383
Cece!

01:28:45.257 --> 01:28:48.623
(SCREAMING)

01:28:48.658 --> 01:28:51.632
NINA: If I were the police,
 maybe I would have
 thought the same thing,

01:28:51.667 --> 01:28:54.963
 that I had drugged
 and tried to drown my baby,

01:28:54.998 --> 01:28:57.072
 that I had swallowed
 a bottle of pills

01:28:57.108 --> 01:28:59.073
 and tried to off myself, too.

01:28:59.108 --> 01:29:01.873
(POLICE RADIO CHATTER)

01:29:06.181 --> 01:29:11.848
NINA: No one would
 believe my husband was
 a cruel, sadistic monster.

01:29:11.883 --> 01:29:14.587
How could a man that handsome,
that successful,

01:29:14.622 --> 01:29:18.153
 that well-loved
 be anything but a saint?

01:29:19.862 --> 01:29:24.192
There is nothing in that attic
except boxes and papers, Nina.

01:29:24.227 --> 01:29:27.635
When you're having delusions,
they can feel very real,

01:29:28.137 --> 01:29:29.905
even when they're not.

01:29:29.941 --> 01:29:33.670
NINA: While they pumped me
 full of antipsychotics,
 antidepressants,

01:29:33.706 --> 01:29:35.973
 all I could think about
 was you.

01:29:38.246 --> 01:29:39.744
 After nine months,

01:29:39.780 --> 01:29:42.016
 I realized the only way
 to get back to you

01:29:42.051 --> 01:29:43.715
 was to admit...

01:29:43.750 --> 01:29:46.555
 what I'd done.
 So, I fell on my knees,

01:29:46.590 --> 01:29:50.422
 confessed everything
 and begged for my freedom.

01:29:50.457 --> 01:29:52.726
We're gonna be so happy, Nina.

01:29:53.495 --> 01:29:55.696
As long as you follow
the rules.

01:29:56.428 --> 01:29:57.665
(ENGINE STARTS)

01:30:35.039 --> 01:30:36.668
NINA: But by that time,

01:30:36.703 --> 01:30:39.540
 I understood
 I'd never be free.

01:30:39.575 --> 01:30:41.135
 No matter
 how hard I tried to prove

01:30:41.171 --> 01:30:43.577
 I was the happiest,
 most perfect wife...

01:30:43.612 --> 01:30:45.982
-(MAN LAUGHING)
 -...in the entire world,

01:30:46.017 --> 01:30:47.042
 Andrew had convinced

01:30:47.078 --> 01:30:51.514
 all those adoring
 shit-for-brain vipers

01:30:51.550 --> 01:30:52.784
 that I was crazy,

01:30:52.820 --> 01:30:55.490
 dangerous, unfit
 to raise my own daughter.

01:30:55.525 --> 01:30:58.052
 And he was crowned
 Husband of the Year

01:30:58.088 --> 01:31:00.860
 for sticking
 by his unhinged wife.

01:31:01.893 --> 01:31:04.264
 Of course,
 he wanted his own baby.

01:31:04.299 --> 01:31:05.794
 But there was no way

01:31:05.829 --> 01:31:07.630
 I was gonna let him plant

01:31:07.665 --> 01:31:09.933
 his evil seed in me.

01:31:09.968 --> 01:31:12.201
 I snuck away to the city,
 got an IUD,

01:31:12.236 --> 01:31:15.643
 the same doctor I eventually
 blackmailed to lie

01:31:15.679 --> 01:31:19.712
 and tell Andrew
 that I was fresh out of eggs.

01:31:19.747 --> 01:31:22.348
 Anything was an excuse
 to lock me up.

01:31:22.383 --> 01:31:23.784
 Leaving the lights on,

01:31:23.820 --> 01:31:26.254
 when you spilled your juice
 at the breakfast table.

01:31:26.289 --> 01:31:27.888
 And any time I fought back,

01:31:27.923 --> 01:31:33.024
 he made sure to remind me
 that he held all the cards.

01:31:33.060 --> 01:31:36.297
 Enzo was my only connection
 to the outside world,

01:31:36.333 --> 01:31:38.464
 the only one who believed me.

01:31:38.499 --> 01:31:40.466
 He tried to help us escape.

01:31:40.501 --> 01:31:41.898
 He got us fake passports,

01:31:41.934 --> 01:31:43.834
 but Andrew found them
 in my drawer

01:31:43.870 --> 01:31:46.576
 and back to the institution
 I went.

01:31:47.739 --> 01:31:49.106
 Every asset was in his name.

01:31:49.141 --> 01:31:51.908
 I had no money, no credit,
 no family, no friends.

01:31:51.944 --> 01:31:53.809
 I was
 a psych ward frequent flier

01:31:53.844 --> 01:31:56.014
 with zero chance at custody.

01:31:56.780 --> 01:31:58.081
 If I tried to run,

01:31:58.117 --> 01:32:00.983
 Andrew would hunt me down
 and drag us back,

01:32:01.018 --> 01:32:03.321
 and everyone would
 call him a hero.

01:32:03.357 --> 01:32:05.161
 I was trapped.

01:32:05.196 --> 01:32:06.321
 There was no chance in hell

01:32:06.356 --> 01:32:09.129
 he would ever let me leave
 the marriage alive.

01:32:09.165 --> 01:32:10.760
 And if I died,

01:32:10.795 --> 01:32:12.261
 what would become of you?

01:32:12.729 --> 01:32:15.004
 What had I done

01:32:15.040 --> 01:32:16.566
 bringing this man

01:32:16.601 --> 01:32:18.234
 into your life?

01:32:19.375 --> 01:32:20.803
 And then it dawned on me.

01:32:20.838 --> 01:32:23.107
 Andrew did have a weakness,

01:32:23.642 --> 01:32:25.813
 his need to be adored.

01:32:29.220 --> 01:32:31.687
 So I started making a plan.

01:32:34.425 --> 01:32:36.725
-You went away again.
-NINA: I know.

01:32:37.160 --> 01:32:39.021
And now I'm back.

01:32:39.056 --> 01:32:41.257
(SIGHS) Andrew found
the passports.

01:32:43.500 --> 01:32:46.998
Look, I know a guy
who could help.

01:32:47.034 --> 01:32:49.870
I think that would only
make things worse for me.

01:32:50.305 --> 01:32:51.571
I could help you.

01:32:51.607 --> 01:32:53.604
You need to stay
out of this, Enzo.

01:32:53.639 --> 01:32:55.677
Listen to me carefully.

01:32:55.713 --> 01:32:58.876
All right? I lost a sister
to a man like Andrew,

01:32:58.911 --> 01:33:01.647
and I will not let
this happen again.

01:33:01.683 --> 01:33:04.453
So now you go,
you pack your bag,

01:33:04.488 --> 01:33:06.684
you take Cece,
and you leave right now.

01:33:06.719 --> 01:33:08.823
I will take care of Andrew.

01:33:09.190 --> 01:33:10.286
No,

01:33:10.788 --> 01:33:12.629
Andrew's gonna leave me.

01:33:14.426 --> 01:33:15.665
How?

01:33:19.735 --> 01:33:21.665
NINA: Millie was
 exactly Andrew's type.

01:33:21.700 --> 01:33:24.839
 Pretty, smart, blonde,

01:33:24.874 --> 01:33:29.140
 all alone in the world,
 someone he'd want to save.

01:33:29.175 --> 01:33:32.647
 Disowned by her parents,
 fired from her last job,

01:33:32.682 --> 01:33:35.448
 broke, no friends,
 living in her car,

01:33:35.483 --> 01:33:37.119
 and the crown jewel,

01:33:37.154 --> 01:33:38.247
 out on parole

01:33:38.283 --> 01:33:41.688
 after serving ten years
 of a 15 year sentence.

01:33:41.723 --> 01:33:44.458
 And not for drugs
 or drunk driving

01:33:44.493 --> 01:33:45.992
 or some other teen bullshit.

01:33:46.925 --> 01:33:49.798
 She was in prison for murder.

01:33:49.833 --> 01:33:52.933
 My plan was to hire
 a pretty girl to replace me.

01:33:54.271 --> 01:33:56.767
 But once I met Millie,

01:33:56.803 --> 01:33:59.005
 I came up with a better plan.

01:34:05.814 --> 01:34:07.781
 Enzo begged me
 to find another way,

01:34:07.816 --> 01:34:10.118
 to leave Millie
 out of all this, but...

01:34:10.154 --> 01:34:13.655
 I knew it was the only way
 I could truly be free
 from Andrew.

01:34:13.690 --> 01:34:16.151
 I made him promise
 not to interfere.

01:34:16.186 --> 01:34:18.695
 It was her
 or it was Cece and me.

01:34:19.263 --> 01:34:20.422
 He reluctantly agreed,

01:34:20.457 --> 01:34:23.194
 but he said he would stay
 to keep an eye on her.

01:34:24.965 --> 01:34:27.234
 Part of me hopes
 you'll never read this.

01:34:27.270 --> 01:34:28.703
 But if you do,

01:34:28.738 --> 01:34:30.971
 I'm glad you know
 the whole story now.

01:34:31.006 --> 01:34:34.743
 I just needed you to know
 I wasn't a bad person.

01:34:34.779 --> 01:34:37.939
Hiring Millie was the only way
I could keep you safe

01:34:37.974 --> 01:34:39.413
 and set us both free,

01:34:39.448 --> 01:34:40.912
 if we get lucky enough

01:34:40.947 --> 01:34:43.447
 to make it
 all the way to free.

01:34:43.482 --> 01:34:47.254
 And I figured if anyone could
 take care of this situation,

01:34:47.290 --> 01:34:48.650
 it was her.

01:34:48.685 --> 01:34:49.924
(GRUNTS)

01:34:52.657 --> 01:34:55.798
(GRUNTING)

01:35:00.534 --> 01:35:02.369
-Millie.
-Ah!

01:35:02.405 --> 01:35:03.839
Millie, please stop.

01:35:04.206 --> 01:35:05.269
Please?

01:35:07.607 --> 01:35:08.709
Open the door.

01:35:08.744 --> 01:35:10.540
-I can't do that.
-Why not? Come on.

01:35:10.575 --> 01:35:12.012
I will.

01:35:12.645 --> 01:35:13.915
Just not yet.

01:35:14.816 --> 01:35:17.045
Andrew, what the fuck
do you want?

01:35:17.080 --> 01:35:18.986
It's irreplaceable, Millie.

01:35:19.452 --> 01:35:20.952
What?

01:35:20.987 --> 01:35:23.292
My grandmother,
she brought this china

01:35:23.327 --> 01:35:24.486
all the way from London.

01:35:25.130 --> 01:35:26.893
And my mother,

01:35:26.928 --> 01:35:29.993
she served every single
holiday meal on it

01:35:30.029 --> 01:35:32.395
with not so much
as a single chip.

01:35:33.029 --> 01:35:36.399
And then you drop it.

01:35:37.308 --> 01:35:39.072
Like a careless child,

01:35:39.440 --> 01:35:40.942
you drop it.

01:35:41.444 --> 01:35:42.938
And on top of that,

01:35:42.973 --> 01:35:45.414
you don't even clean it.

01:35:45.449 --> 01:35:47.914
It was an accident, Andrew.

01:35:47.949 --> 01:35:50.512
Family heirlooms are
a privilege, Millie.

01:35:51.886 --> 01:35:54.588
And now one of mine
is in 21 pieces,

01:35:54.623 --> 01:35:58.153
and you didn't even clean it.

01:35:58.189 --> 01:35:59.857
-(DOORKNOB RATTLES)
-Let me out,

01:35:59.892 --> 01:36:01.457
you're a fucking psychopath!

01:36:01.492 --> 01:36:04.161
I will let you out,
But first, you need to atone.

01:36:04.196 --> 01:36:05.627
-So what you're gonna do...
-(WHIMPERS)

01:36:05.662 --> 01:36:07.969
...is you're gonna take this
piece right here in my hand,

